+## Why
+
+The booking desk has no way to rent out boards and sails. Staff need a rental module that prices and books equipment without double-booking it.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Add `createRentalService()`, exported from `src/index.ts`, returning an in-memory service with `addEquipment`, `quote` and `book`.
+- Enforce the school's rules: integer euro cents, UTC ISO-8601 times, whole-day periods at midnight UTC, no overlapping bookings of the same item.
+- Booking records keep what the cancellation policy (no refund under 24 h before start, otherwise full refund) will need later.
+- Out of scope: cancellation and refunds, persistence, equipment removal.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+- `rentals`: equipment registration, quoting and booking of rentals.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+None.
+
+## Impact
+
+New code under `src/` (none exists yet) and tests. No dependencies added.
